<title>USA: Alcoa Q1 net income per share lower.</title>
<headline>Alcoa Q1 net income per share lower.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.92		    $1.01</p>
<p> Net			159,100		  178,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,231,100		3,149,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 173,122		  175,612</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Aluminum Co of America.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 results include after-tax loss of $1.1 million from asset sales that were offset by an increase to environmental reserves.</p>
